        "original_id": "8eb43896-3a65-5e39-96ab-943e27004380",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Linda Eder, Frank Wildhorn, Steve Cuden, Leslie Bricusse, Robert Louis Stevenson, Christiane Noll\n- Works: Jekyll & Hyde, The Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde, In His Eyes\n- Roles: Lucy\n- Topics: Broadway, musical theater, awards\n\nFacts:\n- Linda Eder, born on February 3, 1961, is an American singer and actress.\n- Jekyll & Hyde is a musical horror-drama loosely based on Robert Louis Stevenson’s novella The Strange Case of Dr Jekyll and Mr Hyde.\n- Jekyll & Hyde was originally conceived for the stage by Frank Wildhorn and Steve Cuden.\n- Jekyll & Hyde features music by Frank Wildhorn, a book by Leslie Bricusse, and lyrics by Frank Wildhorn, Leslie Bricusse, and Steve Cuden.\n- Linda Eder made her Broadway debut in Jekyll & Hyde, where she originated the role of Lucy and received a Drama Desk Award nomination.\n- The song In His Eyes appeared in the original Broadway production of Jekyll & Hyde and was performed by Linda Eder and Christiane Noll.",
